# Initialize simulation
units           metal
dimension       3
boundary        p p p  # Fully periodic for bulk system
atom_style      atomic

read_data       ../../structures/Al.data
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (4.03893 4.03893 4.03893)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
  reading atoms ...
  4 atoms
  read_data CPU = 0.001 seconds
replicate       5 5 5
Replication is creating a 5x5x5 = 125 times larger system...
  orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (20.19465 20.19465 20.19465)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
  500 atoms
  replicate CPU = 0.000 seconds

variable        A1 equal lx*ly  # Surface area in Å²

print          "Initial Area ${A1}"
Initial Area 407.8238886225


# Define interatomic potential
pair_style      eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ../../../../../../modal_app/potentials/EAM/Al99.eam.alloy Al


neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 10 check yes

# Bulk system relaxation
reset_timestep  0
thermo          100
min_style       cg
minimize        1.0e-10 1.0e-10 100000 100000
